    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2>While trying to make his grandfather's dream come true, An unknown creature attacked Pino, which led him to crash-land on the Skyisland. To return home safely, fix his broken plane, and defeat the monster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/e2e4ac8af82a33642c7bcc1028fee530.poster.avif?t=1680489113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/e2e4ac8af82a33642c7bcc1028fee530.webm?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/e2e4ac8af82a33642c7bcc1028fee530.mp4?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game <strong>'SkyIsland'</strong> is an adventure game created by a team of college students. You can use a sword, spear, and hammer as primary weapons and a bow as a secondary weapon. Each weapon has its own identity and temporary skill. You can advance these weapons to make them more powerful.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Charming Levels</h2>SkyIsland has four islands as a theme <br>Spring island 'Epirus' is filled with blue sky, grass, and flowers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/20b7882edb0542187f18a36d4e57fbae.poster.avif?t=1680489113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/20b7882edb0542187f18a36d4e57fbae.webm?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/20b7882edb0542187f18a36d4e57fbae.mp4?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Summer island 'Io' with lush forests and a village of puris.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/d7ad9398808e4733e17f8c4564c99d9e.poster.avif?t=1680489113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/d7ad9398808e4733e17f8c4564c99d9e.webm?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/d7ad9398808e4733e17f8c4564c99d9e.mp4?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Autumn island 'Thessaly' has unpredictable monster-filled wheat fields and many types of mushrooms.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/4f0b1f89ad866bce81002de2d63fb738.poster.avif?t=1680489113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/4f0b1f89ad866bce81002de2d63fb738.webm?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/4f0b1f89ad866bce81002de2d63fb738.mp4?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Winter island 'Crete' where everything is frozen and inhabited but only snow golems.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/2492fac32d6ff3c2843deb31d09d1503.poster.avif?t=1680489113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/2492fac32d6ff3c2843deb31d09d1503.webm?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/2492fac32d6ff3c2843deb31d09d1503.mp4?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Enjoy the game with its fantastic story and graphics!<br><br><br>-----------------------------------------------------------------<br>Sound support - Artive Sound <a href=\"mailto:Team(official@artivesound.com)\">Team(official@artivesound.com)</a><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Translation support</h2>Japanese : \uc815\uc7ac\ud604<br>French : F\u00e9lix Lafargue<br>Spanish : Sergi Castarnado Ord\u00f3\u00f1ez",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2>While trying to make his grandfather's dream come true, An unknown creature attacked Pino, which led him to crash-land on the Skyisland. To return home safely, fix his broken plane, and defeat the monster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/e2e4ac8af82a33642c7bcc1028fee530.poster.avif?t=1680489113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/e2e4ac8af82a33642c7bcc1028fee530.webm?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/e2e4ac8af82a33642c7bcc1028fee530.mp4?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game <strong>'SkyIsland'</strong> is an adventure game created by a team of college students. You can use a sword, spear, and hammer as primary weapons and a bow as a secondary weapon. Each weapon has its own identity and temporary skill. You can advance these weapons to make them more powerful.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Charming Levels</h2>SkyIsland has four islands as a theme <br>Spring island 'Epirus' is filled with blue sky, grass, and flowers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/20b7882edb0542187f18a36d4e57fbae.poster.avif?t=1680489113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/20b7882edb0542187f18a36d4e57fbae.webm?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/20b7882edb0542187f18a36d4e57fbae.mp4?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Summer island 'Io' with lush forests and a village of puris.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/d7ad9398808e4733e17f8c4564c99d9e.poster.avif?t=1680489113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/d7ad9398808e4733e17f8c4564c99d9e.webm?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/d7ad9398808e4733e17f8c4564c99d9e.mp4?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Autumn island 'Thessaly' has unpredictable monster-filled wheat fields and many types of mushrooms.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/4f0b1f89ad866bce81002de2d63fb738.poster.avif?t=1680489113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/4f0b1f89ad866bce81002de2d63fb738.webm?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/4f0b1f89ad866bce81002de2d63fb738.mp4?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Winter island 'Crete' where everything is frozen and inhabited but only snow golems.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/2492fac32d6ff3c2843deb31d09d1503.poster.avif?t=1680489113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/2492fac32d6ff3c2843deb31d09d1503.webm?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302640/extras/2492fac32d6ff3c2843deb31d09d1503.mp4?t=1680489113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Enjoy the game with its fantastic story and graphics!<br><br><br>-----------------------------------------------------------------<br>Sound support - Artive Sound <a href=\"mailto:Team(official@artivesound.com)\">Team(official@artivesound.com)</a><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Translation support</h2>Japanese : \uc815\uc7ac\ud604<br>French : F\u00e9lix Lafargue<br>Spanish : Sergi Castarnado Ord\u00f3\u00f1ez",
